		(at 109.15 121.3 180)
		(descr "0402 (1005 metric, 1.0 x 0.5 mm) MLCC GRM155 / CL05. IPC-7351C least density (D109): lands 0.425 x 0.50 at +-0.4125 (x 0.20..0.625, gap 0.40, overall 1.25 x 0.50). Chip tolerance is set by the worst part on this footprint: Murata GRM155C80J106ME11 spec p1 '3. Type & Dimensions' L 1.0+-0.2, W 0.5+-0.2, e 0.15-0.35, g >= 0.3 (Samsung CL05A475MP5NRNC 1.00+-0.15, CL05A105KA5NQNC 1.00+-0.10, product pages): toe 0.125 past the nominal end, 0.025 at L max 1.20 (0.05 at 1.15); land inner edge 0.20 (terminal inner edge >= 0.15 at g min 0.30, heel -0.05 = IPC L); width 0.50 (= W nominal, side 0). Murata GR*15 (+-0.15/+-0.20) Table 2: a 0.4-0.6 -> 0.40, b 0.4-0.5 -> 0.425, c 0.5-0.7 -> 0.50. Courtyard 1.45 x 0.70. Verifier fix 2026-10-10: the first _L land (0.38 x 0.48 at +-0.39, outer edge 0.58) assumed L +-0.05 and left the GRM155C80J106ME11 terminal uncovered at L max. Derived from lib:C_0402_1005Metric_W (same frame, pad numbers, 3D model, F.Fab body, no component silk); spec hardware/tools/land_specs/C_0402_1005Metric_L.json")
